<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49456" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύω</span> A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>burnt sacrifice</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1409
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύος ὅττι πάχιστον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Aet.Oxy.</u>
					2079.23
				</span></i>
			: but usu. in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺν θυέεσσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.270
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				9.499
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπονδῇσι θύεσσί τε ἱλάσκεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					338
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Maiist.
				11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίσσομ᾽ ὑπὲρ θυέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.261
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύη πρὸ παίδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					835
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(5).593.17
			</span></i> (Iulis, V B.C.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Berl.Sitzb.</u>
				1927.170
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cyrene</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νιν ἐκ θυέων καταδήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					2.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Euph.
				129
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> later in
			pl.,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμιάματα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.104
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>a cake</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύη πέττειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					108
				</span></i>
			.</div>
